Implement user story SKY-001: Scaffold TypeScript project with Vitest and Express

## Story Description
Create the project skeleton at /tmp/skyscanner-app. Initialize a TypeScript Node.js project with: package.json (name: skyscanner-app, scripts for build/test/start/dev), tsconfig.json (strict mode, target ES2022, module CommonJS, moduleResolution Node, outDir dist/), vitest.config.ts, .gitignore, and a src/index.ts entry-point placeholder. Install runtime dependency express and devDependencies typescript, tsx, vitest, @types/express, @types/node. Do NOT install Skyscanner SDKs — RapidAPI is called directly via fetch. The project must compile cleanly and vitest must exit 0 with no test files present.

## Acceptance Criteria
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/package.json exists and the 'name' field equals exactly 'skyscanner-app'
- package.json 'scripts' object contains all four keys: build, test, start, dev
- package.json 'scripts.build' value invokes 'tsc' (e.g. 'tsc' or 'tsc -p tsconfig.json')
- package.json 'scripts.dev' value invokes 'tsx' pointing at src/index.ts
- package.json 'dependencies' includes 'express'
- package.json 'devDependencies' includes all of: typescript, tsx, vitest, @types/express, @types/node
- package.json contains no dependency whose name includes 'skyscanner', 'rapidapi', or any Skyscanner SDK
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/tsconfig.json exists with compilerOptions: strict=true, target='ES2022', module='CommonJS', moduleResolution='Node', outDir='dist/'
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/vitest.config.ts exists, imports defineConfig from 'vitest/config', and exports a default config object
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/.gitignore exists and contains entries for both 'node_modules' and 'dist'
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/src/index.ts exists as a placeholder entry point (may be empty or contain a minimal export/import so tsc has at least one file to check)
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/node_modules/ directory exists (npm install completed successfully)
- Running ~/.nvm/versions/node/v20.20.0/bin/node ./node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit inside /tmp/skyscanner-app exits with code 0 and produces no output
- Running ~/.nvm/versions/node/v20.20.0/bin/node ./node_modules/.bin/vitest run inside /tmp/skyscanner-app exits with code 0 (no test files is an acceptable passing state)

